{"parseRefreshTokenResponse writes a literal string 'refresh_token' when the response lacks a refresh token, which can be persisted to the DB and break future refreshes by overwriting the real refresh token with an invalid placeholder": 0.9146693348884583, "parseRefreshTokenResponse declares a Zod object using computed keys derived from Zod schemas (.toString()), which is not a valid way to express dynamic keys and will fail at build/runtime": 0.8269505500793457, "parseRefreshTokenResponse returns a SafeParseReturnType object ({success, data}), but the Google Calendar code saves this entire wrapper as the credential key, corrupting the database record": 0.9884522557258606, "When credential sync is enabled, refreshOAuthTokens returns a native fetch Response which has no .data property, but Google Calendar code accesses res?.data expecting a GaxiosResponse structure": 0.9770357608795166, "SalesforceCalendarService calls prisma.credential.update without importing prisma, causing a compile-time failure": 0.944431722164154, "SalesforceCalendarService constructs the jsforce.Connection using the pre-refresh access token from credentialKey instead of the newly refreshed token": 0.9398834109306335, "The app-credential webhook does not restrict HTTP methods and uses zod.parse + decrypt + JSON.parse without handling errors, so malformed but authenticated requests will return 500s instead of 4xx": 0.9685191512107849, "APP_CREDENTIAL_SHARING_ENABLED is assigned the raw env var string(s) rather than a boolean, which can lead to accidental misuse and increases the risk of leaking secret values if ever logged or serialized": 0.8128153681755066, "In BiginCalendarService.refreshAccessToken, credentialId (the database credential primary key) is passed as the userId parameter to refreshOAuthTokens instead of credential.userId": 0.9969812035560608, "parseRefreshTokenResponse throws on validation failure instead of returning {success: false}, but Zoom and Salesforce check !parsedToken.success after the call - this is dead code since the throw prevents reaching those checks": 0.9370377063751221}